# Headless acceptance run against a live server.
#
# neko, not hl: the SDK is proven on this target by clients/haxe/PredictProbe,
# and the shared-sim canary passes here bit-for-bit (Haxe gives Int32 semantics
# on neko, so the uint32 RNG is safe despite neko's native 31-bit ints).
-main Acceptance
-cp src
-cp ../../../../colyseus-haxe/src
-lib colyseus-websocket
-lib tink_http
-neko bin/acceptance.n
